WEBVTT

00:00:01.793 --> 00:00:05.130
Hagrid: Come on, now.
Hurry up, you'll be late.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:09.634
Train's leaving. Go on.
Come on, hurry up.

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:18.351
- Come on, Harry.
- One minute.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:28.361
Thought you were leaving
without saying goodbye, did you?

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:33.408
This is for you.

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:52.302
Thanks, Hagrid.

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:02.562
Go on. On with you. On with you now.
Oh, listen, Harry.

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:07.442
If that dolt of a cousin of yours,
Dudley, gives you any grief...

00:01:07.692 --> 00:01:10.361
You could always threaten him...

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.448
With a nice pair of ears
to go with his tail.

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:18.745
But we're not allowed to do magic
away from Hogwarts. You know that.

00:01:19.204 --> 00:01:23.541
I do. But your cousin don't, do he?

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:32.133
Feels strange to be going home,
doesn't it?

00:01:32.383 --> 00:01:34.469
I'm not going home.

00:01:34.636 --> 00:01:36.125
Not really.
